# CR 800.4a: when a player leaves a game that goes on, every object they own leaves with them. In a game of three, Bot2
# pays all 20 life with Channel and loses with a Forest, a Mox Emerald and an Ornithopter on the battlefield: none of
# them is left, nor Bot2's hand or graveyard, and the game goes on between Bot1 and Bot3.

